\" >Use flagships to lead your convoys across the system rather than managing every vessel individually. Built for scale, so even at very high time warp your fleet's physics run reliably and at full performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208770/extras/d0b8eb54ee605a39f483533a948cfd60.poster.avif?t=1781262481\" width=1170 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208770/extras/d0b8eb54ee605a39f483533a948cfd60.webm?t=1781262481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208770/extras/d0b8eb54ee605a39f483533a948cfd60.mp4?t=1781262481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208770/extras/670d7bcd2ac4eab2906fbd60d11c7b24.avif?t=1781262481\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your colony isn’t the only presence in this system, and the same physics  you'll harness to expand your reach can be used against you. Defend your infrastructure and fleet with physics-based projectiles, <i>and prepare for what’s lurking in the outer reaches…</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208770/extras/0cbcd0b000ebddf6abf8c7262af7c3fe.poster.avif?t=1781262481\" width=1170 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208770/extras/0cbcd0b000ebddf6abf8c7262af7c3fe.webm?t=1781262481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208770/extras/0cbcd0b000ebddf6abf8c7262af7c3fe.mp4?t=1781262481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARLY ACCESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch Window is in active development. The core game mechanics - orbital physics, automation systems, and planetary production will be playable on early access release. Your feedback will directly shape what comes next as the star system expands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Major planned features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraforming (atmosphere/water/temperature) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asteroid/comet redirection and mining </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestial dangers (e.g., solar flares)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Megastructures, both orbital and terrestrial </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also expect regular updates adding new technology, buildings, ships, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE STUDIO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gumptiongames  consists of 1 dev, Fred (that's me, hello). Motivated through a love of sci-fi, physics sims, and space in general, I want to create games that capture the vastness of space, have satisfying orbital mechanics, and give the joy of expanding logistics networks. My hope is to bring this ideal to life through <strong>Launch Window</strong>, and I am eager for thoughts and feedback. Please do get in touch!</p>", "short_description": "Launch Window is a single player physics-based automation game where you establish supply chains across an entire solar system using orbital mechanics.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208770/f985ba27978b6db511ce6e6f3eb7c20ab8123aec/header.jpg?t=1781262481", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208770/9afd7783a2032225a6d6bf488fee24c49f18a607/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781262481", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208770/9afd7783a2032225a6d6bf488fee24c49f18a607/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781262481", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> All system requirements will be announced further in development</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["gumptiongames"], "publishers": ["gumptiongames"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable Difficulty"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}, {"id": "70", "description": "Early Access"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208770/38ff7159f397086b26841ac2d40c5beea838c609/ss_38ff7159f397086b26841ac2d40c5beea838c609.600x338.jpg?t=1781262481", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208770/38ff7159f397086b26841ac2d40c5beea838c609/ss_38ff7159f397086b26841ac2d40c5beea838c609.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781262481"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4